.Dd August 14, 2026
.Dt FILEES-PUBLIC-LINKS 5
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm filees-public-links
.Nd FileES public FastCGI configuration
.Pq Pa /etc/filees/public-links.json
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Xr filees-links 8
reads this file.
It does not read
.Xr filees.conf 5
and must not be given SVN credentials.
The schema name is
.Cm filees.public-links/v1 .
.Sh FIELDS
.Bl -tag -width Ds
.It Ic fastcgi.network , fastcgi.address
Listener for
.Xr httpd 8 .
The shipped value is a Unix socket
.Pa /var/www/run/filees/filees-links.sock
owned
.Sy _filees-links : www
mode 0660.
.It Ic backchannel.network , backchannel.address
How links asks
.Xr filees-public-authority 8
for a leaf.
On a shared host this is the Unix socket
.Pa /var/run/filees/public-authority.sock .
A split topology uses loopback TCP provided by a server-established
reverse SSH forward.
Never expose the authority port on a public interface.
.It Ic visit_key_file
HMAC key for signed visit URLs, mode 0600.
.It Ic cache.root , cache.ttl , cache.max_size
Private cache under
.Pa /var/tmp ,
outside backups.
TTL cannot exceed 24 hours.
The shipped values are 12 hours and 10 GiB.
.It Ic bundle.max_files , bundle.max_size
Hard limits for ZIP requests.
.It Ic intake_root , max_upload_size
Closed upload-shelf quarantine.
Must match
.Ic upload.intake_root
in
.Xr filees.conf 5 .
Job subdirectories are mode 0770 so
.Sy _filees-state
can reap them.
.El
.Sh FILES
.Bl -tag -width Ds
.It Pa /etc/filees/public-links.json
Installed configuration.
.It Pa /etc/examples/filees-public-links.httpd.conf
Ordered
.Xr httpd 8
locations to merge into the existing HTTPS origin.
.El
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr filees-links 8 ,
.Xr filees-public-authority 8 ,
.Xr httpd 8
